{title: Aa Chal Ke Tujhe}
{artist: Kishore Kumar}
{key: Eb}

{c: Verse 1}
[Eb]Aa chal ke tujhe, [Eb]main le ke chaloon,
[Eb]Ek aise [Bb]gagan ke taley...
[Bb]Jahaan gham bhi na ho, [Bb]aansoon bhi na ho,
[Bb]Baas pyaar [Eb]hi pyaar paley...
[Eb]Ek aise gagan ke taley!
[Eb]Sooraj ki pehli kiran se,
[Ab]Aashaa ka saveera jaage...
[Bb]Chanda ki [Ab]kiran se dhulkar,
[Eb]Ghanghor andhera bhaage...
[Eb]Kabhi dhoop khile, [Eb]kabhi chaaon mile,
[Eb]Lambi si [Bb]dagar na khaley...
[Bb]Jahaan gham bhi na ho, [Bb]aansoon bhi na ho,
[Bb]Bas pyaar [Eb]hi pyaar paley!
[Eb]Ek aise gagan ke taley!
[Eb]Jahaan door nazar daudaayein,
[Ab]Aazaad gagan lahraaye...
[Bb]Jahaan rang [Ab]birange panchhi,
